Linear API: the `comments` query with a `filter` argument:
```
{
  comments(filter: { author: { id: { eq: "..." } }, createdAt: { gte: "...", lt: "..." } }) {
    nodes {
      id
      body
      createdAt
      issue { id identifier title url }
      parent { id body }
      childComments(first: 100) { nodes { id body author { name } createdAt } }
    }
  }
}
```

The CommentFilter has `createdAt` with gte/lt/lte/gt, and `issue` filter with `state` filter. Also, the `state` of the issue can be filtered with `state: { type: ... }` — actually, CommentFilter has `issue: IssueFilter`, which has `state: { id, type, ... }`.

